{"4327900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Hauler", "steam_appid": 4327900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/679e0f63b6f9d39ec05261f92c6e2bb1.poster.avif?t=1777580188\" width=1140 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/679e0f63b6f9d39ec05261f92c6e2bb1.webm?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/679e0f63b6f9d39ec05261f92c6e2bb1.mp4?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the skies of Titan in a hard-physics space flight simulator. Step into a fully interactive cockpit and manage true-to-life aerodynamics and orbital mechanics to complete freelance contracts and make a name for yourself on the frontier. All in a full scale recreation of the Saturnian system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL COCKPIT CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/8dca712ed4ad3563c2e652c72ac89c34.poster.avif?t=1777580188\" width=1140 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/8dca712ed4ad3563c2e652c72ac89c34.webm?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/8dca712ed4ad3563c2e652c72ac89c34.mp4?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cockpit is fully interactive, where every button, switch and dial has a function. Inspired by real avionics and analog instruments, Space Hauler brings that flight sim depth to the outer Solar System.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TITAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/fb37bf658e747f27290f95a8de7f7707.poster.avif?t=1777580188\" width=1140 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/fb37bf658e747f27290f95a8de7f7707.webm?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/fb37bf658e747f27290f95a8de7f7707.mp4?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on the Saturnian system and its largest moon, Titan. It's the only moon in the Solar System with a dense atmosphere, four times denser than Earth's, and with its forgiving, low gravity, it's the perfect place to earn your wings as a pilot. Titan, and the Saturnian system, has been faithfully recreated in full scale based on real data and observations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLIGHT PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/08d4ce293c65c29b9e104d0a67243e36.poster.avif?t=1777580188\" width=1140 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/08d4ce293c65c29b9e104d0a67243e36.webm?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/08d4ce293c65c29b9e104d0a67243e36.mp4?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spacecraft follows the same rules as the real thing. Aerodynamic lift and drag govern flight inside Titan's thick atmosphere, with control surfaces keeping you in command, and once you climb above it, orbital mechanics take over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SPACE TRUCKER FANTASY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a pilot-for-hire on the frontier. Pick up cargo runs between surface bases, air-drop supplies to remote outposts, deploy satellites into specific orbits, rendezvous with a stranded ship to transfer fuel, or dock with a station that's spinning out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jobs vary, the pay varies, and what you do with the money is up to you: upgrade your ship, save up for something bigger, or just go see what's out there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR &amp; HOTAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the experience with optional VR support, and fly with your preferred HOTAS, flight stick, or gamepad.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/679e0f63b6f9d39ec05261f92c6e2bb1.poster.avif?t=1777580188\" width=1140 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/679e0f63b6f9d39ec05261f92c6e2bb1.webm?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/679e0f63b6f9d39ec05261f92c6e2bb1.mp4?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the skies of Titan in a hard-physics space flight simulator. Step into a fully interactive cockpit and manage true-to-life aerodynamics and orbital mechanics to complete freelance contracts and make a name for yourself on the frontier. All in a full scale recreation of the Saturnian system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL COCKPIT CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/8dca712ed4ad3563c2e652c72ac89c34.poster.avif?t=1777580188\" width=1140 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/8dca712ed4ad3563c2e652c72ac89c34.webm?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/8dca712ed4ad3563c2e652c72ac89c34.mp4?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cockpit is fully interactive, where every button, switch and dial has a function. Inspired by real avionics and analog instruments, Space Hauler brings that flight sim depth to the outer Solar System.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TITAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/fb37bf658e747f27290f95a8de7f7707.poster.avif?t=1777580188\" width=1140 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/fb37bf658e747f27290f95a8de7f7707.webm?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/fb37bf658e747f27290f95a8de7f7707.mp4?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game focuses on the Saturnian system and its largest moon, Titan. It's the only moon in the Solar System with a dense atmosphere, four times denser than Earth's, and with its forgiving, low gravity, it's the perfect place to earn your wings as a pilot. Titan, and the Saturnian system, has been faithfully recreated in full scale based on real data and observations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLIGHT PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/08d4ce293c65c29b9e104d0a67243e36.poster.avif?t=1777580188\" width=1140 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/08d4ce293c65c29b9e104d0a67243e36.webm?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327900/extras/08d4ce293c65c29b9e104d0a67243e36.mp4?t=1777580188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spacecraft follows the same rules as the real thing. Aerodynamic lift and drag govern flight inside Titan's thick atmosphere, with control surfaces keeping you in command, and once you climb above it, orbital mechanics take over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SPACE TRUCKER FANTASY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a pilot-for-hire on the frontier. Pick up cargo runs between surface bases, air-drop supplies to remote outposts, deploy satellites into specific orbits, rendezvous with a stranded ship to transfer fuel, or dock with a station that's spinning out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jobs vary, the pay varies, and what you do with the money is up to you: upgrade your ship, save up for something bigger, or just go see what's out there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR &amp; HOTAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the experience with optional VR support, and fly with your preferred HOTAS, flight stick, or gamepad.</p>", "short_description": "Space Hauler is a space flight sim set around Saturn's largest moon, Titan. Fly your spacecraft using realistic aerodynamics and orbital mechanics, take on contracts, and build your career as a pilot-for-hire.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/